                                                "sense_id": "8b1cfc8d-4bd6-3cfd-825b-ceb0a25a2d63",
                                                "text": "Then Mambro handed me his manuscript, a sheaf of loose pages really, his cursive handwriting scrawled over them, the exaggerated tails of the f’s and the j’s, the distinct loop of the q."
                                            }
